## 1. Method and search limits

- Pekko source root: `upstream/pekko/actor/src/main/` (`scala/org/apache/pekko/**`, `java/**`, `resources/reference.conf`, plus version dirs `scala-2.12`, `scala-2.13`, `scala-2.13+`, `scala-3`, `scala-jdk-9`, `boilerplate`). Paths are relative to `actor/src/main/scala/org/apache/pekko/` unless they start with `java/`, `scala-2.13/` or `resources/`. Specs live in `actor-tests/src/test/scala/org/apache/pekko/`.
- Enumerated by grep of top-level `class|trait|object` per file and by reading `reference.conf` key groups. `private[pekko]`/`private[io]` definitions are marked INTERNAL (not Pekko public API); listed only when a public capability depends on them.
- One row per capability, not per method. Line numbers are those of the defining class/object/method at this commit.
- "Specs observing it" cites the spec file and the line of the test titles I read (titles only; I did not run specs and did not read assertion bodies). "none found" names the search: file-name listing of `actor-tests/src/test` plus grep of the symbol.
- goPekko state: read from `develop/pekko-actor/**/*.go` (33 production files, 4,920 lines) by grep of exported identifiers. "absent" = no exported identifier or file implements it.
- Scope classes use only ADR 0033 (accepted 2026-10-24), the accepted ADRs (0011, 0012, 0014, 0017, 0021, 0024, 0030, 0031) and the epic #746 ACTINV table. ADR 0010 (including its "Excluded for now" list, `:225`), ADR 0008 and ADR 0015 are `proposed` in develop, so that list is NOT an accepted exclusion record. ADR 0033 D8 is an accepted category exclusion for network-bound `actor.io`; D13 limits exclusions to the agreed local frontier and documented JVM-only APIs, but no accepted record enumerates the JVM-only list yet.
- Evidence/oracle status: ADR 0033 D13. I did not determine oracle applicability. Default: `pend-det` = oracle applicability pending determination (register is #1034 JDG-04). I did not read `judge/`, so judge-coverage claims are the dossier's and unverified by me.
- Limits: assertion bodies of most specs not read; ByteString/ByteIterator internals not read; `mima-filters` not read; classic `testkit` source not read (only ADR text, section 8); stories matched from `epic746.md` (ACTINV table) and `act2_index.tsv` titles, not each issue body.

Legend, Scope: `inc` included (story exists); `inc-ns` included-no-story; `exc-rec` excluded-recorded; `exc-prop` excluded-proposed (a GOV/decision story title proposes it; not decided); `uncl` unclassified. `ACTINV-n` rows marked "retained" are implemented with no open story.

